 * source: corpus/chm/windows-ce-5.0/wcevail5/html/wce50lrfCONFIG_DATA_.html  borrowed from chm
 * row: CONFIG_DATA_PHONE_INFO_DIALOUTPREFIX = 0x0008 Prefix that indicates a call for which external dialing rules should be applied. For example, "9". XML element and registry entry name: dial_out_prefix LDAP name: CEVoIP-DialOutPrefix
