/* CONFIG_DATA_PHONE_INFO_USERNAME
 * row: CONFIG_DATA_PHONE_INFO_USERNAME = 0x0001 Name of the phone's user. For example, "John Doe". XML element and registry entry name: username LDAP name: name
 * source: corpus/chm/windows-ce-5.0/wcevail5/html/wce50lrfCONFIG_DATA_.html  borrowed from chm
 * row: CONFIG_DATA_PHONE_INFO_USERNAME = 0x0001 Name of the phone's user. For example, "John Doe". XML element and registry entry name: username LDAP name: name
